- 8: other execute (0001)

Substitutions:
- If setuid (04000) is set: position 2 shows 's' if 0100 is set, 'S' if not
- If setgid (02000) is set: position 5 shows 's' if 0010 is set, 'S' if not
- If sticky (01000) is set: position 8 shows 't' if 0001 is set, 'T' if not

